note as BIZ_diagram_35_messaging
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Provides durable domain events, transactional outbox publication, subscriptions,
  generic worker queues, retries and dead-letter evidence. User notification delivery
  is separated into module 35B while remaining in the same messaging schema.
end note

