note as DEP_diagram_35_messaging
  Connects to directory.tenants, iam.users, terminology.catalog_concepts and all
  write modules. Domain events and outbox rows are committed with the business change.
end note

note as REC_OUTBOX_diagram_35_messaging
  TRANSACTIONAL OUTBOX CONTRACT
  A persistent relay worker claims rows with SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED,
  honours idempotency_key, applies bounded retries and moves exhausted work to DLQ.
  External providers are never called inside the business transaction.
end note

note as REC_POLY_MSG_diagram_35_messaging
  domain_events.(aggregate_type, aggregate_id) is polymorphic. The aggregate_type
  discriminator must use a closed value set and be validated against entity_registry.
end note

