note as BIZ_diagram_35b_notification_delivery
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Handles consent-aware, template-driven delivery over configured channels and
  providers. Requests, attempts and receipts remain traceable without copying PHI into
  provider payloads beyond the minimum approved for the notification purpose.
